sound GCC.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text There are several local history books archived in this room, and something much like the ball of light you saw was mentioned as a folktale.
sound GCD.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Do you want to read it?
text @[Tomoya]
text Nah, reading isn't my thing... I want to hear it from you.
sound GCE.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Sure. But even with that said, there's not much detail written anywhere.
sound GCF.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text Some said they're the pappi on the seeds of some plant, others said they're a species of dragonfly... There is nothing but speculation.
sound GCG.aac
text @[Miyazawa]
text However, there is one thing they have in common...
